{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yubikit\/loggingguide"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No setup is required. YubiKit defaults to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"debug"},{"text":" on stdout when compiled with ","type":"text"},{"code":"DEBUG","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or ","type":"text"},{"code":"info","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on stderr otherwise. You can override either default:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import YubiKit","import Logging","","\/\/ Show warnings and errors.","YubiKit.Logs.configure(logLevel: .warning)","","\/\/ Use your preferred backend.","YubiKit.Logs.configure(logLevel: .debug) { label in","    StreamLogHandler.standardOutput(label: label)","}","","\/\/ Turn logging off.","YubiKit.Logs.configure { _ in SwiftLogNoOpLogHandler() }","","\/\/ Restore defaults.","YubiKit.Logs.configure()"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Add ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift-log","type":"reference"},{"text":"’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"Logging","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" product to your app target","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to use its backend types. Any SwiftLog ","type":"text"},{"code":"LogHandler","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" can be supplied by the factory.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each call replaces both settings. Omitting the factory restores YubiKit’s backend;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"omitting the level uses the selected handler’s level. Changes apply to existing sessions,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"though logs already in progress may use the previous settings."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"YubiKit’s configuration does not affect other libraries. To share your app’s backend,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pass its factory explicitly; global "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LoggingSystem.bootstrap"},{"type":"text","text":" does not select YubiKit’s backend."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Factories may run concurrently and must not log through YubiKit themselves."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Traffic logging","anchor":"Traffic-logging","type":"heading","level":3},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["YubiKit.Logs.configure(logLevel: .trace)"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Raw traffic and SCP plaintext logs require ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"YubiKit to be compiled with ","type":"text"},{"code":"DEBUG","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Neither configuration nor a custom backend can enable them in other builds.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Custom connections are responsible for their own traffic logging.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Debug logs can include account names and credential identifiers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Trace logs can include PINs, credentials, and cryptographic keys. Protect or redact logs before sharing them."}]}],"style":"warning","type":"aside","name":"Warning"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Custom-backends","text":"Custom backends","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Labels identify categories, such as ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.OATH","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.FIDO","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Metadata carries details such as byte counts and error codes; the default backend displays","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"these as ","type":"text"},{"code":"key=value","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" pairs. Message wording and metadata keys are not a stable API.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend controls formatting, storage, and export. YubiKit does not retain log messages.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Logging","modules":[{"name":"YubiKit"}]},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Choose YubiKit’s log level and backend with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Logs\/configure(logLevel:factory:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/LoggingGuide","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Preparing-your-project","title":"Preparing your project","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Logs"]}],"references":{"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/documentation/YubiKit/Logs":{"title":"Logs","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Configures logging for YubiKit connections and sessions."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/yubikit\/logs","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Logs","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Logs","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Logs"},"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/documentation/YubiKit/GettingStarted":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Prepare your project to connect to the YubiKey via NFC, SmartCard, Lightning and USB HID.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","title":"Getting Start